<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>How It Works | StudentHub</title><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/theme.js?v=${applicationScope.assetVersion}"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/css/public.css?v=${applicationScope.assetVersion}"><script src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/assets/js/public.js?v=${applicationScope.assetVersion}" defer></script></head><body class="public-page"><jsp:include page="partials/header.jsp"/><main><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container"><p class="eyebrow">A clear path in</p><h1>From account to academic community.</h1><p>Five simple steps connect each student to relevant campus information.</p></div></section><section class="journey-section"><div class="public-container journey"><article><span class="journey-number">01</span><div><h2>Create your account</h2><p>Register with your student identity.</p><span class="journey-chip">TNT Student ID</span></div></article><article><span class="journey-number">02</span><div><h2>Set academic information</h2><p>Add your university, semester and section.</p><span class="journey-chip">Semester · Section</span></div></article><article><span class="journey-number">03</span><div><h2>Join your scope</h2><p>StudentHub connects you to the right academic community.</p><span class="journey-chip">Relevant access</span></div></article><article><span class="journey-number">04</span><div><h2>Receive relevant updates</h2><p>See announcements, deadlines and notifications.</p><span class="journey-chip">Timely information</span></div></article><article><span class="journey-number">05</span><div><h2>Stay connected</h2><p>Use focused discussion rooms for your scope.</p><span class="journey-chip">Academic discussion</span></div></article></div></section>
<section class="roles-section"><div class="public-container"><div class="section-title"><p class="eyebrow">Designed for every role</p><h2>Clear capabilities, shared academic context.</h2></div><div class="role-grid"><article><span class="role-icon">S</span><h3>Student</h3><ul><li>View announcements</li><li>Track deadlines</li><li>Receive notifications</li><li>Join discussions</li></ul></article><article><span class="role-icon">CR</span><h3>Class Representative</h3><ul><li>Everything students can do</li><li>Publish academic updates</li><li>Share assignments and exams</li><li>Communicate by scope</li></ul></article><article><span class="role-icon">A</span><h3>Admin</h3><ul><li>Manage users</li><li>Maintain academic data</li><li>Review change requests</li><li>Oversee the community</li></ul></article></div></div></section>
<section class="final-cta"><div class="public-container"><div><p class="eyebrow">Start organized</p><h2>Join your academic community.</h2></div><a class="button primary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/register">Create Account →</a></div></section></main><jsp:include page="partials/footer.jsp"/></body></html>
